  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: b8c5f8bea1b438d4687ad9b712e77c3e, type: 3}
  m_Name: Level 1-4 Starting Cutscene
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::CutsceneData
  line:
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Many of us lived in the same house. There was my aunt, two cousins,
      and three half-cousins. My manner of life was simple. I heard mass at four
      if there were a service so early, or studied at that hour and went to mass
      after. Then I went out in the yard to look for apples. Then came breakfast,
      where I ate a plate of rice and two dried sardines. There was class work until
      ten and after lunch a study period.
    isLeftSide: 0
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: "In the afternoon, there was school from two o\u2019clock until five.
      Next, there would be play with my cousins for a while. Study and perhaps painting
      took up the remainder of the afternoon. At night came supper, one or two plates
      of rice with fish. In the evening we had prayers and then, if it was moonlight,
      a cousin and I would play in the street with the others."
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: Fortunately, I was never ill while away from home. From time to time,
      I went to my own village. How long the trip seemed going, and how short coming
      back!
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 1
  - speakerName: Jose Rizal
    speakerType: 0
    hero: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 618ec32722d755e4e80a7f213a9d80b0, type: 2}
    enemy: {fileID: 0}
    Dialogue: A lot of things happened which would take too long to explain and tiring
      to read. Finally came a letter from my sister Saturnina which announced that
      the steamer would stop for me on a certain day. I said my goodbyes to my friends
      and teacher. I expressed my sadness in leaving and gratitude for his instruction.
    isLeftSide: 1
    pose: 2
